			<zone xml:id="p2z39-0" points="995,3135 1451,3152 1726,3105 1968,3155 2095,3117 2095,3042 995,3057">1008,3103 1062,3100 1117,3099 1171,3097 1226,3094 1281,3091 1335,3088 1390,3088 1444,3088 1499,3085 1554,3085 1608,3085 1663,3085 1717,3085 1772,3085 1827,3088 1881,3090 1936,3093 1990,3094 2045,3097 2100,3103</zone>
